==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|blanquet||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{bor|en|fr|blanquette}}, from {{der|en|prv|blanqueto}}, a diminutive of {{m|oc|blanc||white}}, derived, through {{der|en|LL.|-}} and {{der|en|VL.|*blancus}}, from {{der|en|frk|*blank||gleaming, white, blinding}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*blankaz||white, bright, blinding}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bhleg-||to shine}}.<br/> Compare {{m|en|blanket}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{wikipedia|blanquette de veau}}
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/blɒ̃ˈkɛt/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/blɑ̃ˈkɛt/|/blɑŋˈkɛt/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛt|lang=en}}

